 "sentences": [
  "Meet the Nazi SS Skanderbeg division.",
  "It was a German mountain infantry unit formed during World War II.",
  "The troops were mostly Muslim and Catholic Albanians led by German officers.",
  "They were named after a medieval Albanian lord who fought the Ottoman Empire.",
  "Despite its name, it never actually reached full divisional strength.",
  "After the war, the Waffen-SS was declared a criminal organization."
